# Striaton City (a city of cafés and a Trainers' School, where three brothers serve tea and battles): a vibraphone tune
# in D major over strings and plucked chords, a bouncing bass and a brushed beat. At night a celesta takes the tune.
# Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U10).
